<title>NETHERLANDS: NORIT FIRST-QUARTER NET PROFIT UP 51 PCT.</title>
<headline>NORIT FIRST-QUARTER NET PROFIT UP 51 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMERSFOORT, Netherlands 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>First qtr 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.56 vs   0.37</p>
<p>    Net profit			     6.8  vs   4.5</p>
<p>    Turnover			     103.3  vs  69.3</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    10.5  vs   6.5</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     0.5  vs   0.1 gains</p>
<p>    Tax					3.2  vs   2.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Activated carbon maker Norit NV previously said it</p>
<p>expected profits to rise in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
